{{Quote|What was this place?''"<br />"''An ancient temple built by my ancestors. The Nightsisters of Dathomir.|[[Shin Hati]] and [[Morgan Elsbeth]]|<ref name="Part One" />}}
The '''Nightsisters' Temple''' was a [[temple]] that was constructed by the [[Nightsisters]] of [[Dathomir]] thousands of [[Standard year|years]] before the [[Battle of Endor]], was located on the [[Planet|world]] of [[Arcana]].

==History==
By the [[New Republic Era|time]] after the [[Galactic Civil War]], the temple had been reduced to ruins.<ref name="Part One" />

In [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date" /> [[Ahsoka Tano]] [[Mission to Arcana|journeyed]] to the Nightsisters' Temple on the [[planet]] [[Arcana]] and completed a puzzle to acquire the [[Arcana Star Map]] that led to the [[far galaxy]] where [[Grand Admiral]] [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo|Thrawn]] was believed to have been [[Exile (punishment)|exiled]]. After acquiring the [[star map]], Tano was attacked by multiple [[HK-87 assassin droid]]s, whose [[Self-destruct mechanism|self-destruct sequences]] burnt down what remained of the temple.<ref name="Part One" />

